heptapod@gmail.com wrote:
>
> Is it true that if the player knows of a trap that their pet will be
> aware of a trap, actively avoiding it and the consequences?

If a pet sees the trap trigger, then the pet knows the trap is there.

If you trigger a trap while the pet is out of sight, then the pet does
not know the trap is there.

If you find a trap by searching while the pet is in sight, I don't know.

> I started a game in UnNetHack and while fighting some jackals on DL1
> next to a pit my dog fell in and died.

Happens in plenty of games.  I seem to lose a lot of pets to falling
rock traps.  Players with a helmet rarely die to a falling rock trap but
by the time your pet has polymorphed to be able to wear a helmet it's
already got enough hit points that one rock don't kill it.


